Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you, O 'Kaseen?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood of the children in their body
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want to know how to get rid of them
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want to know how to get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Wargreymon to fight Wargreymon and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperialdramon in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,battle of Black Wargreymon,\Nwhat would you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\fscx110\fscy110\pos(259,275)}BlackWarGreymon's Seal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think they\Nmake mittens for wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a more permanent solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Digimon like Daemon will keep\Ntrying to break through to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite reports that monsters\Nhave been appearing worldwide,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,government agencies have\Nbeen hesitant to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've dismissed these sightings as the\Nwork of practical jokers and goofballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, recent incidents have prompted\Nofficials to take the issue seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a press conference today,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was revealed that\Nthe so-called monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be considered\Nunidentified life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Home Defense Force is expected\Nto head up the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the public is being strongly cautioned\Nnot to panic and to stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't monster-proof\Nyour homes yet, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say that it's probably\Nnothing but a silly hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, did you hear a noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just my stomach growling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I hear it coming\Nfrom somewhere down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it took my prune juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, I made a boo-boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When food's put in front of\Nme, I just can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, I'm sorry for keeping this\Nfrom you, but it's just that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew there was something fishy going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuffed animal's got more\Nthan cotton balls in his stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, he's not from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been transported from another\Ndimension, maybe a digital one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I hearing you right, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know about the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you find out about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's what you kids\Nare calling it these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose it was\Nonly a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I'd have to tell you at some point,\Nbut I didn't expect to do it so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Cody, it has to do with your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he was just a young rascal like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he always talked about going to some\Nstrange place like a digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean my dad knew about it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think too much of it at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he was always interested in\Nvideo games and things of that sort,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But suddenly he started doing things\Nthat really worried me Sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'd be playing a game And he'd act\Nlike he was seeing things that no
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one else did As if the characters\Nactually came to life He'd sit at
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that TV for hours in a trance Sometimes\Nhe'd even carry on conversations,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought, with himself It gave me the\Nwillies, if you want to know the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was playing around,\Nbut he knew they were real Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not planning on going\Nout again by yourself Oh, come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom Please no you've been out every\Nday this week and with all this talk
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about monsters it worries me I'd\Nrather you stay at home today honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's gonna happen besides my\Nfriends are expecting me You worry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too much all that monster talk is\Nprobably just rumors and hearsay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and I are going to\Ngo practice our kendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those despicable Digidestined\Nhave been snooping
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around keeping tabs on all\Nthe other little urchins
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dark spores have begun to take\Nroot in their teensy little brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a slight complication.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one brat whose spore\Nis about to sprout early.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without the dark spore, I'd\Njust become an ordinary bumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small potatoes doomed\Nto a life of mediocrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll be able to rise above the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you up to? Can I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to achieve perfection\Nif inferior people keep trying to butt in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom was worried and\Ndidn't want me to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't blame her, but\NI'm sure glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better go get something to eat\Nbefore it's time for the next shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:06:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A chocolate bar is calling\Nout my name. See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mind bringing me back something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about quiche?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if it's quiched or\Nsquashed, as long as it's edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My book!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to leave my things alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're interrupting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see if you\Nneeded any help, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That spore's growing fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could break glass with that scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's giving me a headache,\Nimagine how her mama feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's progressing very nicely, and\Nthere's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just go home. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that people who\Ndon't move never get ahead in life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.09,0:06:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You afraid to improve your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, why be merely ordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better than being\Ncontrolled by a fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody is being controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did is grant their wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you're just jealous that\Nthey'll become more powerful than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you happen to change\Nyour mind, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, don't\Nattempt to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've made their choice and\Nit's too late to turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they make a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been brainwashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made them all a\Nbunch of false promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say they're going to\Nbecome superior beings,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you don't even know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A superior being is someone who\Nhelps and cares about others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name on that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says Hida.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiroki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my dad's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There goes our lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll eliminate that little twit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to eat later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't feel like it when\Nwe are finished with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there like\Na couple of silly fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.90,0:07:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he could have at least said, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, do as I say. Ingrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiroki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's similar in so many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't let myself give in\Nto weakness when I'm so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hiroki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a vision for the future\Nthat everyone said was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you always encouraged\Nme to keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never fit in as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all laughed at me\Nand thought I was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never did, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was as if we were\Nmade from the same mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I care? He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fool I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happiness is an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life's ugly and cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why has he come back to haunt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let his memory\Nkeep me from my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there was only some way I could\Nshow you the virtual beings I created,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd understand what\NI'm about to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made digital copies of my own DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:09:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The copies were computer-generated into\Nsolid images of my own genetic essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll never win a beauty\Ncontest But after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's what's inside that counts And that's\Nnot much What are you trying to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're horrid and empty, so\Nget over it. You're baiting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop it. What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid to face the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We represent the essence of\Nyour ugliness. We're living your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nightmare lies! You were just\Na foreign object. You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mind-boggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had the perfect opportunity to lift\Nthose kids in the butt, and he stopped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's two tacos short of a combo platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but remember that\Nconversation with Blackmore Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a Digimon, and Oikawa's a\Nhuman, so what are we supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopped liver?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Virtual viruses?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horror film wannabes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, my dear, this is\Ngiving me a vast feeling of inferiority.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I ever mention you're\Nthoroughly pathetic when you whine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get to the bottom of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, quit your harping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're exasperating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa. What is it? I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you say my dad was a good guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dad was a very good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was as good as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you ask me\Nsomething like that, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met a man yesterday who\Nsaid that he'd known him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just curious about it, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was the man's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me his name was Oikawa. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Ken Ichijoji, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that spying is rude?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.74,0:10:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something you need to\Nknow about before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something I need to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, why should I\Ncare what you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you're an ordinary kid\Nagain, you're just an insect to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.44,0:11:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave it all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The brains, the power, and for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So people would like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, so I would like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power gave me nothing but loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to believe me, Noriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're going to tell me that the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,answer is having friends\Nand parents who love you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you don't even\Nbelieve what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be harder than I\Nthought, but I have to keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let her suffer like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here, so do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bug off, insect boy. Yo, Ken. Hey, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with her? Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, you really must have made her mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uwekawa and his fan club.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get three guesses and\Nthey're all her. No way. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wyrm-on Digibolb-doo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digibolb!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beem-on Digibolb-doo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Beem-on Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EXP-MOD!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,STEN-MOD!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DEAN-AN DIGITAL 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,IELDRAGON!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TESTING!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ESPERONAL BLUSTER!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wanna watch you kick the bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about the others, we've\Ngot to get that girl back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the Tailmon armor digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.68,0:13:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid old Dilloman's fit to be tied!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This oughta cool you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See the dance lessons for later you might\Nhurt the girl Noriko get away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still under his control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to your playpen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, big guy, can you\Neyeball what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks like she's absorbing the\Nflower That's what I call flower-powered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't steal her energy just\Nto make yourself more powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just using her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's doing this of her own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That flower's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, use for her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would be better off\Nimproving your mind rather than
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wasting time with all the\Nsaving-the-world nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you see where it got your father how\Ndare you talk about my father like
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that he'd never approve of what you've\Ndone you don't oh my i believe you've
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gone and upset the little fellow he's\Nso much like his father especially
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I look into his eyes, Miroki was\Nalways on the side of justice, but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those days are gone this isn't a good
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sign at all the energy he received
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the flower appears to be forming\Na force field behind him what could
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it be i hope it isn't going to take
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long we didn't get any lunch it's black
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Work Raymond, something's wrong. I can\Nfeel it. Oh, you must be stopped, terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's your turn.\NLooks like I'm just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power of the force that\Nattracted him like a magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe his domination over the\Nditch in a world is threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say\Nhe's not very happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blackboard Raymon, this is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:16:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a dark influence permeating that\Ncloud, and I need to find out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oikawa, we have unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you come back to face the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make use of the energy from the\Ncontrol spires that created your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My power far surpasses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be signing your own death warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop flattering yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're simply an electronic being.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you create your two flunkies\Nbecause you were afraid to be alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cat got your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm that foolish?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can obliterate you in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.50,0:16:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think they like each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he was\Nfriends with Cody's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's got some\Nmajor issues to work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.45,0:16:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, uh, this is getting\Nextremely complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's Black War\NGrey Mine doing back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's with the purple cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that power is\Ngoing to bring you happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, then you're living in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power isn't going to help\Nyou escape the loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:17:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you feel because you\Ndon't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just makes it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more powerful you get,\Nthe more alone you become.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't take the truth, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came as fast as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to get here so late, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, but I remember\Nyou were a good friend of Hiroki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never had many friends, and I always\Nthought you were a bit of an odd duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I never imagined\Nyou'd go completely mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to know how I know\Nyou so well? Yukio?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm Cody's grandfather\Nand Hiroki's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two spent hours together playing\Ngames and making up outrageous stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.36,0:17:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You actually believed\Nthe characters were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so lost in this world,\NI thought your minds would rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty soon I had to put my foot\Ndown and bring an end to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You both took it very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still remember the\Nsad looks on your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things never changed as you grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still spent long\Nperiods of time dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about that strange other world of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never let anyone else\Nshare in your thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because if you did, you were\Nafraid they would take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiroki was gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were beside yourself with grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You became a lost and lonely soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't normal, but then\NHiroki had been your only friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have seen it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.02,0:18:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have tried to\Nmake it easier for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone so sad in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, it was a very\Ndifficult thing to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not be interested in hearing\Nthis, but I'd like to be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be nice to talk\Nto someone about my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.02,0:18:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that would be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must miss him even more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from there, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not looking too neighborly to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He protected Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be something more\Nto this than we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.20,0:19:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have been so blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're perfectly right about being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.90,0:19:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're both doomed to\Nremain this way forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's controlling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very perceptive for\Nsomeone so narrow-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to harvest all the dark spores in\Norder for me to fulfill my deepest desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to\Ngo to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must not be allowed into\Nthe digital world ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever tells me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all right, big guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's not going to last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The image created by the control\Nspires will soon start to break up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's still something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.94,0:20:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your strength. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My strength is my final\Ngift to you, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will seal the Highton View\NTerrace gate with my own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it! I must!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always wanted to do something\Nmeaningful with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say this definitely qualifies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BlackwarGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BlackwarGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BlackwarGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish there had been another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, BlackwarGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.26,0:20:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a true friend, and\NI'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what can I do to generate?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always tell you how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always tell you how to do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.20,0:22:03.21,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.21,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.22,0:22:17.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.10,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the power of the\Nwhite tree was opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.66,0:22:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shadow of a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shadow of a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the enemy of the Phantomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, the adventure of the Phantomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the gate is closed.
